{
  "id": "22653_sendou",
  "headword": "{先導|せんどう}",
  "reading": "せんどう",
  "romaji": "sendou",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "guidance; leading the way",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "guidance; leading the way; spearheading",
      "explanation": "The act of going ahead to show the way or taking the lead in guiding a group or initiative."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "22653_sendou_ex1",
      "japanese": "パレードを{先導|せんどう}する。",
      "english": "To lead a parade.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "22653_sendou_ex2",
      "japanese": "{警察|けいさつ}の{車両|しゃりょう}が{先導|せんどう}して{進|すす}んだ。",
      "english": "A police vehicle led the way.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "22653_sendou_ex3",
      "japanese": "{彼女|かのじょ}はプロジェクトの{先導|せんどう}{役|やく}を{務|つと}め、チーム{全体|ぜんたい}をまとめた。",
      "english": "She served as the project leader and brought the whole team together.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "A compound of {先|せん} (ahead/first) and {導|どう} (guide/lead). Implies physically or figuratively going ahead to show the way for others to follow.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {先導|せんどう}する: to lead, to guide\n- {先導|せんどう}{役|やく}: leader, guide (role)\n- {先導|せんどう}{車|しゃ}: lead vehicle, escort car\n- {先導|せんどう}のもとに: under the guidance of\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {案内|あんない}: guidance — more everyday; implies showing around or giving directions\n- {指導|しどう}: instruction, coaching — implies teaching or supervising rather than going ahead\n- {誘導|ゆうどう}: guidance, leading — implies directing or channeling movement, often in a controlled manner\n- {船頭|せんどう}: boatman — a homophone with an unrelated meaning",
